title: Door3B
---
// Talk target of 3B's door (Interact layer). It opens with the actions here: a popup
// when several are available, the only one at once. Each picks by story state.
-> Knock <<if not visited("Route1Viewing")>>
    <<next_scene Route1Viewing>>
-> Go in <<if visited("Route1Viewing") and not visited("Route1Croissant")>>
    You: Not yet. Her croissant's getting cold.
-> Go in <<if visited("Route1Croissant") and not visited("Route1DinnerDoor")>>
    You: She said eight. Not ten past.
-> Look
    <<if not visited("Route1Viewing")>>
        You: 3B. The one from the listing.
    <<else>>
        You: 3B. My door. Still feels like someone else's.
    <<endif>>
===
